  "related_review": [
    "Reviewed graphics detection traversal, shader regeneration, cached soft-ground uniform discovery, startup recovery, loading-cover completion, zone shader warm-up and desktop engine patch provenance.",
    "The soft-ground shader-uniform warning is emitted when shader identity or source changes; the existing cache prevents repeated discovery for unchanged shaders. No steady-state per-frame scan was found in that path.",
    "Shader warm-up submits a finite material set in batches. RenderingDevice backends finish that set while Compatibility uses the existing time budget. No Windows driver lockup was reproduced; this release does not change that policy or the Windows Direct3D 12 default.",
